{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03438","headline":"代春闺 · 崔液","name":"代春闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南日暖鸿始来，柳条初碧叶半开。\n玉关遥遥戍未回，金闺日夕生绿苔。\n寂寂春花烟色暮，檐燕双双落花度。\n青楼明镜昼无光，红帐罗衣徒自香。\n妾恨十年长独守，君情万里在渔阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔液","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}